    "caption": "🚀 Get Ready for Eurasia Technology Week 2025 in Istanbul! 🇹🇷✨\n\nWe’re selecting 5 startups to represent Kazakhstan at Eurasia Technology Week 2025 from April 17-19 at the Istanbul Expo Center! 🌍💡\n\n🔹 What’s covered?\n\n✅ FREE accommodation in Istanbul 🏨\n✅ FREE startup booth to showcase your startup 🎯\n✅ B2B networking with investors, tech leaders & potential partners 🤝\n✅ Access to 20,000+ visitors, 200 exhibitors & 100+ speakers\n\n🔎 Who’s eligible?\n\n🔹 Must be a tech park resident (Astana Hub)\n🔹 Fintech and Telecom sectors are preferred \n🔹 Your product should be at the PMF stage or beyond\n🔹 Fluency in English is required 🌎\n🔹 Compliance with the key areas of the forum;\n\n✈️ Important: Startups must cover their own transportation (flights to and from Istanbul).\n\n📢 Only 5 startups will be selected! Apply now for this incredible opportunity!\n\n📅 Deadline: 25th March 2025\n\n📍 Apply via the link in bio, “Events” section!",
